                                                "sense_id": "a487082e-3f8d-318a-977b-4ae411c4555d",
                                                "text": "Aside from their pierogis, their menu also includes Ukrainian borscht soup, nalysnyky crepes and uzvar, a traditional drink made out of dried fruits and honey."
                                            }
                                        ]
